The reference code in tests/reference/seedvr and tests/reference/official_window.py
comes from ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR under Apache-2.0. Original files, license text,
source commit, and file hashes are retained. The window planner, AWA implementation
and export modules adapt that model's mathematics to C++/ncnn/pnnx; their derivation
and FP32-B reference adaptations are described in docs/provenance.md.

ncnn/pnnx are from Tencent/ncnn (BSD-3-Clause). The application uses a separately
recorded host-buffer-v1 allocator adaptation. Dependency archives remain unchanged.
Third-party headers, frontend packages and their license notices are recorded in
third_party/, dependencies.lock.json and the other lock files.

The NASA astronaut fixture and its derived test images are public domain as
documented by scikit-image. Attribution and exact source are retained in
tests/fixtures/natural/provenance.json. Synthetic test media and saved numerical
reports are diagnostic examples, not a representative restoration benchmark.

Model weights are not distributed in this source repository. The download script
fetches the pinned official model repository; its license applies to those files.

